            "content": "The plan's maximum duration is until March 5, 2027. The first trade will not occur until September 14, 2026, at the earliest. The trading plan is intended to permit Ms. Hood to sell (i) up to 48,700 shares of our common stock, (ii) 100% of net vested shares of our common stock pursuant to Restricted Stock Awards that will vest on August 31, 2026, and (iii) 100% of net vested shares of our common stock pursuant to Restricted Stock Awards that will vest on February 28, 2027.",
